(text "REFERENCE BIAS: sources 01Studio board sheets1/2/4 and Canaan guide. Not a fabrication release." (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "d142c1b7-d550-44d2-847a-9271de3c1b5c"))
(text "C61 is across the TOP VREF resistor, not another VREF-to-ground capacitor. Divider tracks the 1.1V DDR rail." (at 15 240 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "98307a30-3226-4b26-9788-ad5cf6be0cb5"))
(text "TEST_EN A9 is grounded in master. EMMC_VDDI is an internal regulator node, NEVER an external 1.8V supply input." (at 15 247 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "2b8504f3-9663-482b-80d2-b4f6e5eaa60f"))
